lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯预测AGI最快将于2029年至2030年间实现</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云百炼平台全面CLI化并开源，一行命令实现AI Agent全栈能力编排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9cd3b8616edb03050c7b7597a596ef01.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年5月29日，阿里云百炼正式宣布全面CLI化并向全球开发者开源。该CLI工具将模型调用、应用工作流、知识库检索、长期记忆管理、联网搜索及本地多模态处理等核心能力统一封装，支持开发者通过一行命令在Claude Code、Qwen Code、OpenClaw等主流AI Agent框架中快速调用百炼平台能力。针对当前AI Agent落地中多点API对接与参数配置复杂的痛点，阿里云百炼CLI实现了从单点模型调用向多能力复杂协同编排的跨越，助力构建具备业务深度的企业级智能助手。目前，项目已在GitHub开源，并收录20余个专家Skills及Showcase项目。此举旨在降低复杂任务流构建门槛，通过社区共建推动大模型应用生态的工程化落地，为开发者提供更轻量、可脚本化的Agent开发范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿波罗与黑石筹资360亿美元，为Anthropic租赁谷歌TPU芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6125686a72adff615a40c0379ea677c4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿波罗全球管理公司与黑石集团正联合发起一项规模约360亿美元的债务融资交易，旨在为AI独角兽Anthropic构建人工智能基础设施。这是全球规模最大的私募信贷交易之一，采用“以租代买”模式，专项用于购买谷歌定制化AI芯片TPU，并由Anthropic租用以获取算力。博通公司为该交易中规模最大的部分付款提供了信用背书，确保Anthropic获得稳定的算力通道。受此消息影响，博通盘后股价上涨1.9%，Alphabet股价上涨1.2%。此次交易标志着大模型军备竞赛已进入比拼底层算力资源与资本整合能力的全新阶段，通过华尔街资本与芯片巨头的深度绑定，为Anthropic在激烈的市场竞争中提供了关键的算力保障。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯预测AGI最快将于2029年至2030年间实现</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/84449dc887a89f3a0bbb15a35f6a0730.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind首席执行官德米斯·哈萨比斯近日公开表示，通用人工智能（AGI）的研发进度超预期，最快可能在2029年至2030年间实现，即未来三年内或将迎来关键突破。哈萨比斯指出，当前多模态理解、自主决策及AI智能体等核心技术的快速成熟，正为AGI的到来奠定基础，且AGI的演进将是一个持续的升级过程。与专用人工智能不同，AGI具备跨领域的学习、推理与创造能力，一旦落地将彻底重塑生产力格局。哈萨比斯同时发出警示，随着未来AI系统具备自我优化与自主迭代能力，全球社会在规则制定与防护机制上的准备严重不足，人类适应技术变革的时间窗口已非常紧迫。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0abdab7b4d7ad50812eef5efd682ce06.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软计划在下周旧金山Build开发者大会上发布多款自研AI模型，旨在完善自有AI体系并降低对外部供应商的依赖。针对GitHub Copilot面临的市场竞争，微软将推出一款高性价比代码专用模型，作为Claude Code的平价替代方案。此外，微软还将发布覆盖语音转写、逻辑推理、语音处理及图像生成等场景的系列模型，并通过Azure云平台向开发者开放采购。此次战略调整标志着微软正加速摆脱对OpenAI和Anthropic技术的过度依赖，通过构建自研模型矩阵降低365 Copilot等产品的内部运营成本。随着OpenAI技术使用权到期节点的临近，微软此举预示着全球大模型市场竞争重心正从单纯的能力比拼，转向深度的成本控制与生态应用对决，意在通过高性价比策略赢回价格敏感的开发者群体。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/586ea7f7c8e46311aad7a53a6bebca82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三菱日联金融集团（MUFG）正式向旗下三菱日联银行约3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise，标志着该集团向“AI-native”企业转型。自2024年10月与OpenAI合作以来，MUFG通过全员培训及定制化GPT工作坊，助力员工在四个月内创建超1,800个“AI银行家”工具。目前，这些AI助手已在研究任务及简报准备中将员工日常工作量降低20%至30%。此外，MUFG计划在旗下数字银行品牌emutt中推出AI驱动的“AI礼宾”服务及多资产咨询平台，旨在实现24/7个性化客户服务。管理层表示，此举旨在通过AI优化内部运营效率，将节省的时间投入到客户拜访及决策审批等高价值业务中，从而构建全新的金融服务生态。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
